01:05:49.860 --> 01:05:50.920
It can be hatched today.

01:06:19.930 --> 01:06:22.030
Commence a plan.

01:06:40.300 --> 01:06:41.820
All aircraft type target.

01:07:02.330 --> 01:07:03.750
All tank units begin the attack.

01:09:00.090 --> 01:09:00.430
Hold on.

01:10:34.700 --> 01:10:35.800
Begin operation B.

01:10:35.900 --> 01:10:36.220
Yes, sir.

01:10:48.300 --> 01:10:48.740
Brown Godzilla.

01:11:39.180 --> 01:11:41.620
Squadron XY alert, the net is lined up.

01:11:42.080 --> 01:11:44.440
Squadron XY alert, the net is lined up.

01:13:01.120 --> 01:13:04.480
Got him. Yes. Increased voltage.

01:13:05.070 --> 01:13:09.330
Turn power up. Captain, we're registering too much voltage for safety now.

01:13:10.310 --> 01:13:11.070
Increased voltage.

01:14:00.250 --> 01:14:01.970
All right, men's plan C.

01:14:40.620 --> 01:14:42.560
Take the boat out! Take me to the island!

01:14:42.700 --> 01:14:43.360
I'm not going out there!

01:14:43.650 --> 01:14:45.270
This vessel wouldn't have a chance against Godzilla!

01:14:45.570 --> 01:14:46.630
Please, take me there!

01:14:46.930 --> 01:14:47.670
Get off this boat!

01:14:47.730 --> 01:14:48.690
I've got to get there!

01:14:52.730 --> 01:14:53.270
Get off there!

01:14:53.310 --> 01:14:54.150
I've got to get there!

01:14:54.370 --> 01:14:54.910
Get off the boat!

01:14:56.340 --> 01:14:58.460
But children, it still remains out there on the island!

01:14:59.040 --> 01:14:59.560
Hold on there!

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:01.560
There are children on the island and teachers.

01:15:01.820 --> 01:15:04.440
They mustn't stay there. We've got to rescue them.

01:15:05.230 --> 01:15:05.890
It's too late!

01:15:06.280 --> 01:15:07.870
That's enough! We'll be killed!

01:15:08.330 --> 01:15:09.150
Let's get out of here!

01:17:31.560 --> 01:17:32.890
Look at that, too!

01:17:35.720 --> 01:17:55.240
You see, Godzilla?

01:17:55.840 --> 01:17:56.840
It's headed for Iwo Island.

01:17:57.580 --> 01:17:58.200
Iwo Island?

01:17:58.420 --> 01:17:58.700
Yes.

01:17:58.990 --> 01:17:59.970
Children and teachers are...

01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:00.740
Trapped on the island.

01:18:32.720 --> 01:18:34.960
The children! They will be killed!

01:18:37.640 --> 01:18:42.730
Children, as you can!

01:19:12.250 --> 01:19:13.370
We can save the children now.

01:19:13.550 --> 01:19:13.870
We can?

01:19:14.530 --> 01:19:16.490
While Godzilla's fighting, we'll go around the island.

01:19:20.130 --> 01:19:20.570
Cast off.

01:21:30.410 --> 01:21:30.510
Good.

01:21:32.490 --> 01:21:33.170
How's that go?

01:21:34.310 --> 01:21:34.870
Land there!

01:25:31.340 --> 01:25:31.880
Hurry!

01:27:00.000 --> 01:27:00.040
Thank you.

01:27:49.420 --> 01:27:51.700
All right, let's go.

01:29:30.000 --> 01:29:59.980
Thank you.

01:30:00.000 --> 01:30:00.140
Thanks for watching!
